you answer a question,

00:02:55.821 --> 00:02:58.224
maybe 15 different questions,
with the same theme,

00:02:58.224 --> 00:03:00.117
different answers, the same theme,

00:03:00.117 --> 00:03:01.997
it really now just hit me.

00:03:01.997 --> 00:03:04.644
Like, wow, I really now
understand what you mean of

00:03:04.644 --> 00:03:06.199
'execution's the game, idea's shit.'

00:03:06.199 --> 00:03:07.787
Of course, ideas aren't shit, but boy,

00:03:07.787 --> 00:03:11.200
everybody's got an idea."

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:12.418
Things like that, and so

00:03:12.418 --> 00:03:14.727
I think the consistency of doing it,

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:16.795
the consistency of there being

00:03:16.795 --> 00:03:18.513
four to 15 things I believe in,

00:03:18.513 --> 00:03:20.546
hard work, you know, not being romantic

00:03:20.546 --> 00:03:21.787
about the current state of the marketplace

00:03:21.787 --> 00:03:23.854
and always putting
yourself out of business,

00:03:23.854 --> 00:03:27.226
being 51-49 to the other person,

00:03:27.226 --> 00:03:29.200
so just actually being authentic enough

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:32.660
that you know yourself, that
your answers align in that way,

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:34.343
and then just making
it interesting and fun,

00:03:34.343 --> 00:03:36.084
and different settings,

00:03:36.084 --> 00:03:38.743
the outside energy mixed
up with being in my office,

00:03:38.743 --> 00:03:40.646
the predictions at the end of the show,

00:03:40.646 --> 00:03:42.805
those will go away after
the football season.

00:03:42.805 --> 00:03:43.978
So, you know, just mixing it up,

00:03:43.978 --> 00:03:46.602
so putting pressure on the format

00:03:46.602 --> 00:03:48.878
while letting the essence
always be the same.

00:03:48.878 --> 00:03:52.464
Being the same person even
though you grow up and mature

00:03:52.464 --> 00:03:55.379
and maybe change your
outfits, grow facial hair,

00:03:55.379 --> 00:03:57.340
get older, start losing hair,

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.197
but still always being that same person,

00:03:59.197 --> 00:04:00.620
but evolving with the times.

