00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:53.086
I'm worried about the defense,

00:18:53.086 --> 00:18:53.982
I know the Texans have not

00:18:53.982 --> 00:18:57.011
given up a touchdown in ten quarters,

00:18:57.011 --> 00:18:58.347
but I think the Jets go in there,

00:18:58.347 --> 00:18:59.369
season on the line,

00:18:59.369 --> 00:19:00.634
the Jets know if they lose this game

00:19:00.634 --> 00:19:02.631
they will not make the playoffs.

00:19:02.631 --> 00:19:05.683
16-13 New York Jets,

00:19:05.683 --> 00:19:08.173
I look for Eric Decker to have a huge day.

00:19:08.173 --> 00:19:09.549
You keep asking questions,

00:19:09.549 --> 00:19:11.767
I'll keep answering them.

00:19:11.767 --> 00:19:14.831
(pounding hip-hop music)

